language ESSENCE' 1.0
$ Find five nontransitive dice whose beats relation matches Rock-Paper-Scissors-Lizard-Spock.
find dice : matrix indexed by [int(1..5), int(1..6)] of int(1..12)

branching on [dice]

such that
$ symmetry breaking: a die's faces form a multiset, so they are listed in non-decreasing order
$ (permuting the faces of one die keeps its beats relations; this only removes face orderings)
forAll i : int(1..5) . forAll p : int(1..5) . dice[i,p] <= dice[i,p+1],
$ Rock(1) crushes Scissors(3): Rock beats Scissors in more than half of the face pairs
(sum p : int(1..6) . (sum q : int(1..6) . toInt(dice[1,p] > dice[3,q]))) >= 19,
$ Rock(1) crushes Lizard(4): Rock beats Lizard in more than half of the face pairs
(sum p : int(1..6) . (sum q : int(1..6) . toInt(dice[1,p] > dice[4,q]))) >= 19,
$ Paper(2) covers Rock(1): Paper beats Rock in more than half of the face pairs
(sum p : int(1..6) . (sum q : int(1..6) . toInt(dice[2,p] > dice[1,q]))) >= 19,
$ Paper(2) disproves Spock(5): Paper beats Spock in more than half of the face pairs
(sum p : int(1..6) . (sum q : int(1..6) . toInt(dice[2,p] > dice[5,q]))) >= 19,
$ Scissors(3) cuts Paper(2): Scissors beats Paper in more than half of the face pairs
(sum p : int(1..6) . (sum q : int(1..6) . toInt(dice[3,p] > dice[2,q]))) >= 19,
$ Scissors(3) decapitate Lizard(4): Scissors beats Lizard in more than half of the face pairs
(sum p : int(1..6) . (sum q : int(1..6) . toInt(dice[3,p] > dice[4,q]))) >= 19,
$ Lizard(4) eats Paper(2): Lizard beats Paper in more than half of the face pairs
(sum p : int(1..6) . (sum q : int(1..6) . toInt(dice[4,p] > dice[2,q]))) >= 19,
$ Lizard(4) poisons Spock(5): Lizard beats Spock in more than half of the face pairs
(sum p : int(1..6) . (sum q : int(1..6) . toInt(dice[4,p] > dice[5,q]))) >= 19,
$ Spock(5) vaporizes Rock(1): Spock beats Rock in more than half of the face pairs
(sum p : int(1..6) . (sum q : int(1..6) . toInt(dice[5,p] > dice[1,q]))) >= 19,
$ Spock(5) smashes Scissors(3): Spock beats Scissors in more than half of the face pairs
(sum p : int(1..6) . (sum q : int(1..6) . toInt(dice[5,p] > dice[3,q]))) >= 19
